         if np.isinf(data[col]).any():\n611 |                 raise ValueError(\n612 |                     f\"Column {col} contains infinity or -infinity\"\n613 |                     \"which is outside the range supported by Stata.\"\n614 |                 )\n615 |             value = data[col].max()\n616 |             if dtype == np.float32 and value > float32_max:\n617 |                 data[col] = data[col].astype(np.float64)\n618 |             elif dtype == np.float64:\n619 |                 if value > float64_max:\n620 |                     raise ValueError(\n621 |                         f\"Column {col} has a maximum value ({value}) outside the range \"\n622 |                         f\"supported by Stata ({float64_max})\"\n623 |                     )\n624 |         if is_nullable_int:\n625 |             if orig_missing.any():\n626 |                 # Replace missing by Stata sentinel value\n627 |                 sentinel = StataMissingValue.BASE_MISSING_VALUES[data[col].dtype.name]\n628 |                 data.loc[orig_missing, col] = sentinel\n629 |     if ws:\n630 |         warnings.warn(\n631 |             ws,\n632 |             PossiblePrecisionLoss,\n633 |             stacklevel=find_stack_level(),\n634 |         )\n635 | \n636 |     return data\n```\n\nFound function `pandas/core/arrays/boolean.py:BooleanDtype.type`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n77 | def type(self) -> type:  # type: ignore[override]\n78 |         return np.bool_\n```\n\nFound function `pandas/core/dtypes/dtypes.py:NumpyEADtype.type`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n1547 | def type(self) -> type[np.generic]:\n1548 |         \"\"\"\n1549 |         The type object used to instantiate a scalar of this NumPy data-type.\n1550 |         \"\"\"\n1551 |         return self._dtype.type\n```\n\nFound function `pandas/core/dtypes/dtypes.py:SparseDtype.type`.\nSource: Retrieved entity using keyword search (bm25).\n```\n1898 | def type(self)